# COPY TO .Renviron IF YOU NEED TO OVERRIDE DEFAULTS.
# DO NOT PUT CREDENTIALS IN YOUR PUBLIC REPOSITORY.
# The MFT API is not called until someone explicitly clicks Import from MFT.
# BIOSPACE_MFT_BASE_URL=https://YOUR-AUTHORISED-MFT-SERVICE
# DIGITAL_TAGGING_DATA_DIR=data/local
# DIGITAL_TAGGING_APP_HOST=127.0.0.1
# DIGITAL_TAGGING_APP_PORT=3838
# DIGITAL_TAGGING_API_HOST=127.0.0.1
# DIGITAL_TAGGING_API_PORT=8000

# QR API in a separate RStudio session / process. Change to :6730 if that is your port.
# DIGITAL_TAGGING_QR_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
